thub.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-29T21:48:31Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T21:48:31Z","body":"> Should I rename the option to `cvtt_export_templates`?\r\n\r\nYes, but if anyone has a better idea as to naming these options, let me know.\r\n\r\n> Betsy would require a separate option too?\r\n\r\nYes, as you won't enable it when targeting the web platform or when making a project that targets the Compatibility renderer.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3349169255/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3350068077","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111015#issuecomment-3350068077","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111015","id":3350068077,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Hrftt","user":{"login":"Alexofp","id":14040378,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDQwMzc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14040378?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexofp","html_url":"https://github.com/Alexofp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexofp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexofp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexofp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexofp